---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="Tools by Prem Poddar - web apps that run in the browser" description="Small web apps I built that you can use right here: no install, no account. Starting with a scientific calculator that only has two buttons." full absolute>
  <header class="intro">
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <p class="lede">Things I built that you can use right here in the browser. No install, no account, nothing leaves your device.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="tools" aria-label="The tools">
    <a class="tool" href="/tools/two-button-calculator/">
      <span class="mini" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="lcd">
          <span class="idle">0</span>
          <span class="live">2.718281828</span>
        </span>
        <span class="keys">
          <span class="k">1</span>
          <span class="k eml">EML</span>
        </span>
        <span class="brand">SCIENTIFIC · 2-BUTTON</span>
      </span>
      <span class="body">
        <span class="kicker">tool 01</span>
        <h2>Two-Button Scientific Calculator</h2>
        <p>The machine from the Numberphile video, working: two buttons that can do the whole keypad. Type any expression and watch it compile into the exact presses, then copy them back into the calculator.</p>
        <span class="ids" aria-hidden="true">e = EML(1, 1) · exp(x) = EML(x, 1) · x − y = EML(ln x, exp y)</span>
        <span class="open">Open the calculator <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a class="tool" href="/tools/chat/">
      <span class="mini" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="bubbles">
          <span class="b dark"></span>
          <span class="b light"></span>
          <span class="cursor"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="brand">NO-TRACE · P2P · EPHEMERAL</span>
      </span>
      <span class="body">
        <span class="kicker">tool 02</span>
        <h2>No-Trace Chat</h2>
        <p>A temporary room for quick handoffs: messages, photos and files, encrypted, device to device. Close the tab and it's all gone.</p>
        <span class="ids" aria-hidden="true">room code = 3 words · owner approves · 8 people max</span>
        <span class="open">Open the chat <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <aside class="bench" aria-label="Coming next">
    <h2>On the bench</h2>
    <p>nothing yet, the desk is full for now</p>
  </aside>
</Page>

<style>
  .intro h1 { font-size: var(--step-3); }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); max-width: 56ch; margin: 0.6rem 0 2.4rem; }

  .tools { display: grid; gap: 1.4rem; max-width: 40rem; }
  .tool {
    display: flex; gap: 1.6rem; align-items: center;
    background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--paper-edge); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem; box-shadow: var(--lift);
    color: inherit; text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
  }
  .tool:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--lift-high); border-color: var(--pen); }

  /* the device, drawn in CSS */
  .mini {
    flex: none; width: 172px; background: var(--mat); border: 1px solid var(--mat-major);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.8rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--mat-major);
  }
  .lcd {
    position: relative; display: block; height: 2.4rem;
    background: var(--ink); border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .lcd span {
    position: absolute; right: 0.7rem; top: 50%; translate: 0 -50%;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 1.02rem; color: #b8f5c9;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; transition: opacity 160ms ease;
  }
  .lcd .live { opacity: 0; }
  .tool:hover .lcd .live { opacity: 1; }
  .tool:hover .lcd .idle { opacity: 0; }
  .keys { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.45rem; margin-top: 0.55rem; }
  .k {
    display: block; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--mat-major);
    border-radius: 6px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.95rem; text-align: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--mat-major);
    transition: background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
  }
  .tool:hover .k.eml { background: var(--pen-soft); border-color: var(--pen); }

  /* the chat device, drawn in CSS */
  .bubbles { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; min-height: 2.5rem; }
  .b { display: block; height: 1.05rem; border-radius: 0.55rem; }
  .b.dark { width: 72%; background: var(--ink); }
  .b.light { width: 52%; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--mat-major); align-self: flex-end; }
  .cursor { display: none; width: 0.55rem; height: 1rem; background: var(--pen); align-self: flex-end; }
  .tool:hover .cursor { display: block; animation: blink 1s steps(2, start) infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { to { visibility: hidden; } }

  .brand {
    display: block; margin-top: 0.6rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--muted); text-align: center;
  }

  /* the text side */
  .body { display: block; }
  .kicker {
    display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .tool h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .tool .body > p { margin: 0 0 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--step-0); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 44ch; }
  .ids {
    display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--mat); border: 1px dashed var(--mat-major); border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .open { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; font-weight: 650; color: var(--pen); }
  .arrow { display: inline-block; transition: translate 160ms ease; }
  .tool:hover .arrow { translate: 3px 0; }

  /* the sticky note for what's next */
  .bench {
    position: relative; margin: 2.6rem 0 0; width: fit-content; max-width: 20rem;
    background: var(--note); color: var(--note-ink); font-family: var(--hand);
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 18px -10px rgb(60 50 0 / 0.45);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }
  .bench::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -9px; width: 64px; height: 20px; translate: -50% 0;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55); border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
  }
  .bench h2 { font-family: var(--hand); font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 0.2rem; }
  .bench p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.2; }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .tool { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 1.2rem; padding: 1.2rem; }
    .mini { margin: 0 auto; }
    .ids { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tool, .lcd span, .k, .arrow { transition: none; }
    .tool:hover { transform: none; }
    .tool:hover .cursor { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
